            "value": "Highlights"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Huidig doel houden": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keep current target"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ik heb dit gelezen en begrepen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "I have read and understood this"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "In onderzoek vlakt de gezondheidswinst bij volwassenen af rond 8.000 tot 10.000 stappen per dag, bij 60-plussers rond 6.000 tot 8.000. Kies een doel dat je op de meeste dagen haalt; verhogen kan altijd.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Research shows the health benefits for adults level off around 8,000 to 10,000 steps a day, and around 6,000 to 8,000 for people over 60. Pick a goal you hit on most days; you can always raise it."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Instellingen": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Settings"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je doel is %@ stappen per dag.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your goal is %@ steps a day."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je doel is verhoogd naar je rustverbranding. Lager gaan we niet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your target was raised to your resting expenditure. We don't go lower."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je doel past bij je verbruik. Ga zo door.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your target fits your expenditure. Keep it up."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je doel staat op je rustverbranding. Lager gaan we niet, ook niet als je sneller wilt.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your target is at your resting metabolic rate. We do not go lower, even if you want to go faster."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je doel staat op je rustverbranding. Lager gaan we niet.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your target is at your resting metabolic rate. We do not go lower."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je eerste sessie legt je basislijn vast. Kies een gewicht waarmee je nog 2 à 3 reps overhoudt.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Your first session sets your baseline. Pick a weight that leaves 2 to 3 reps in the tank."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Je geschatte 1RM ten opzichte van je lichaamsgewicht, op basis van 1 lift.": {
      "localizations": {
